	<names>
		<name lang="en">EL9410 power feed terminal with diagnostics</name>
		<name lang="fr">EL9410 borne d'alimentation avec diagnostic</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Beckhoff</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">EL9410</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">EtherCAT Terminal, power feed terminal with diagnostics</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT Terminal, power feed terminal with diagnostics. Pins as drawn after the user's reference picture (left column 1 to 4, right column 5 to 8): 1 +24 V DC (Us), 5 0 V; 2 and 6 Infeed 24 V, 3 and 7 Infeed 0 V, 4 and 8 PE, the last three pairs linked to the power contacts. The card has no I/O channel.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Generic layout redrawn from a reference picture, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license
Schematic view made by misc/beckhoff/gen_el9410.py: the supply, the infeeds and the power contacts are generic, check them against the datasheet. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
